Source: orafce
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), bison, flex
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/orafce/orafce

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-orafce
Architecture: any
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Oracle-compatible functions and packages for PostgreSQL
 Orafce implements Oracle-compatible SQL functions, operators and packages in PostgreSQL.
